  "_comment": "PLUGIN frames for both test suites (server/src/protocol.test.ts and src/components/workbench/plugins/pluginFrame.test.ts), so the two decoders cannot drift. docs/plugin_batch_implementation_plan.md 3.3 and 6.3.",
